2-2. Surveys of actual conditions of registered information under Article 5-2 of the Act;
3. Requests for correction and supplementation of registered information under Article 6 (1) of the Act;
3-2. Rectification or cancellation of registered information under Article 6-2 of the Act;
3-3. Receipt, examination and determination of objections, and notification of their results, under Article 6-3 (1) and (2) of the Act;
4. Imposition and collection of administrative fines under Article 33 (1) 1 and 2 of the Act.
(2) Pursuant to Article 29 (1) of the Act, the Minister of Agriculture, Food and Rural Affairs shall delegate authority to receive applications for designation of joint agricultural business entities under Article 27-3 (3) of the Act to the head of a Si/Gun/Gu. <Newly inserted on September 19, 2017>
